      "releaseNotes": "MORE THAN ONE BAND\nPlay in a band, a choir and a trio? Tap the band's name to switch. Each band keeps its own players, setlists, rehearsals and notes.\n\nMORE THAN ONE SETLIST\nGive each band as many setlists as it needs: Sunday service, the wedding, the club set. Pick one before you record and its songs are the ones you tap while you play.\n\nEverything you already have stays where it is.",
